{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 5, :comments ["<b>And testify against</b> — Yefet said: like <b>בני יענה</b> (Genesis 33:19). And it has no sense, except it is from the root ענה."], :book :hosea, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 5, :notes {0 "Ibn Ezra rejects Yefet's comparison to בני יענה (sons of Yana, a place name); he takes וענה as from the root ענה 'to answer/testify'."}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Hosea -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/daat/olam_hatanah/mefaresh.asp?book=15&perek=1&mefaresh=ezra"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:50:15.441188319Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}